  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed building the **PhishGuard** autonomous cybersecurity threat intelligence application, faithfully matching the design and functional specifications from the provided screens.\n\n### Design & Architecture Overview\n\n- **Aesthetic & Visual Identity**: \n  - Designed with an immersive, high-contrast Security Operations Center (SOC) dark theme utilizing deep obsidian navy surfaces (`#0c1322`, `#141b2b`, `#191f2f`, `#232a3a`), sharp telemetry accents in cyan/mint (`#4fdbc8`), high-urgency crimson (`#ff5451` / `#93000a`), and electric violet (`#a078ff` / `#d0bcff`).\n  - Strict typographic hierarchy pairing **Plus Jakarta Sans** for display headings, **JetBrains Mono** for forensic indicators, IPs, and code telemetry, and **Inter** for dense body readability.\n  - Integrated Material Symbols with custom font-variation optical sizing, filled glyphs, and responsive hover/press states.\n\n- **SOC Command Center (Dashboard)**:\n  - **Live Global Radar Grid**: Features active node ping markers across US East, Frankfurt, Tokyo, Singapore, S\303\243o Paulo, and Sydney with real-time zero-day ingestion counters and latency tickers.\n  - **KPI Metric Matrix**: High-contrast tiles displaying *Intercepted Phishing Vectors (1,420)*, *Active Zero-Day Threats (184)*, and *Mean Containment Time (142ms)* with trend velocity indicators.\n  - **Live Threat Telemetry Feed**: Real-time stream of suspicious incoming domains with immediate *Inspect* and *Quarantine* triggers.\n  - **Tactical Playbook Cards**: Interactive modules for *Credential Harvester Containment*, *Punycode Homograph Neutralization*, and *OAuth Consent Phishing Triage* with dedicated step-by-step SOC execution drawers.\n\n- **Neural URL Scanner (Deep Diagnostic Inspector)**:\n  - **Omnibar Interceptor**: Input bar with paste recognition, target URL clear, and quick rescan capabilities.\n  - **Risk Verdict Banner**: Prominent zero-day credential harvester classification with threat explanations.\n  - **Circular Neural Threat Gauge**: Dynamic SVG score dial (0\342\200\223100) calibrated with confidence ratings, domain age indicators, heuristic divergence, and clone match percentages.\n  - **Core Security Findings**: Breakdown of typosquatting homographs, exfiltration destinations, and anti-sandbox obfuscation routines.\n  - **URL Feature Matrix & SSL Inspection**: Deep inspection cards detailing special character entropy, keyword traps, ASN routing, and Let\'s Encrypt TLS freshness with one-click domain quarantine, STIX 2.1 IOC export, and raw HTTP stream packet dump.\n\n- **Threat Telemetry & Scan Audit Log**:\n  - **Multi-Status Filter Pills**: Instant filtering across *All Verdicts*, *Malicious*, *Suspicious*, and *Safe* records, complete with count badges.\n  - **Full-Text Omnibar Filter**: Fast filtering by domain, IP, hash, or trigger.\n  - **Forensic Modal Drawer**: Slide-up sheet providing deep registrar intel, fast-flux DNS TTLs, and DOM clone attack vectors.\n  - **Bulk Remediation Footer**: Multi-select actions to batch quarantine threats or export audit trails directly to CSV.\n\n- **Sentinel AI Advisor (Interactive Cyber Intelligence Assistant)**:\n  - **Dual Interaction Modes**: Switch between structured text diagnostics and active voice recognition modes.\n  - **Voice Orb Diagnostic Visualizer**: Kinetic radar orb with harmonic audio frequencies, pulsing waveforms, and simulated voice synthesis.\n  - **Analytical Timeline**: Conversational thread demonstrating automated classification rationale, homoglyph root cause analysis, DNS sinkhole injection, and SIEM ticket generation.\n  - **Tactical Prompt Chips**: One-click quick queries for Punycode analysis, OAuth verification, DKIM/DMARC headers, and YARA rule generation.\n\n- **SOC Engine & Radar Configuration**:\n  - Fine-grained controls to toggle heuristic detection sensitivity (*Aggressive*, *Balanced*, *Strict*), automated DNS sinkhole injection, external threat feeds (*AlienVault OTX*, *VirusTotal*, *PhishTank*, *CISA*), and SIEM dispatcher integrations."
    modified_response: "I have completed building the **PhishGuard** autonomous cybersecurity threat intelligence application, faithfully matching the design and functional specifications from the provided screens.\n\n### Design & Architecture Overview\n\n- **Aesthetic & Visual Identity**: \n  - Designed with an immersive, high-contrast Security Operations Center (SOC) dark theme utilizing deep obsidian navy surfaces (`#0c1322`, `#141b2b`, `#191f2f`, `#232a3a`), sharp telemetry accents in cyan/mint (`#4fdbc8`), high-urgency crimson (`#ff5451` / `#93000a`), and electric violet (`#a078ff` / `#d0bcff`).\n  - Strict typographic hierarchy pairing **Plus Jakarta Sans** for display headings, **JetBrains Mono** for forensic indicators, IPs, and code telemetry, and **Inter** for dense body readability.\n  - Integrated Material Symbols with custom font-variation optical sizing, filled glyphs, and responsive hover/press states.\n\n- **SOC Command Center (Dashboard)**:\n  - **Live Global Radar Grid**: Features active node ping markers across US East, Frankfurt, Tokyo, Singapore, S\303\243o Paulo, and Sydney with real-time zero-day ingestion counters and latency tickers.\n  - **KPI Metric Matrix**: High-contrast tiles displaying *Intercepted Phishing Vectors (1,420)*, *Active Zero-Day Threats (184)*, and *Mean Containment Time (142ms)* with trend velocity indicators.\n  - **Live Threat Telemetry Feed**: Real-time stream of suspicious incoming domains with immediate *Inspect* and *Quarantine* triggers.\n  - **Tactical Playbook Cards**: Interactive modules for *Credential Harvester Containment*, *Punycode Homograph Neutralization*, and *OAuth Consent Phishing Triage* with dedicated step-by-step SOC execution drawers.\n\n- **Neural URL Scanner (Deep Diagnostic Inspector)**:\n  - **Omnibar Interceptor**: Input bar with paste recognition, target URL clear, and quick rescan capabilities.\n  - **Risk Verdict Banner**: Prominent zero-day credential harvester classification with threat explanations.\n  - **Circular Neural Threat Gauge**: Dynamic SVG score dial (0\342\200\223100) calibrated with confidence ratings, domain age indicators, heuristic divergence, and clone match percentages.\n  - **Core Security Findings**: Breakdown of typosquatting homographs, exfiltration destinations, and anti-sandbox obfuscation routines.\n  - **URL Feature Matrix & SSL Inspection**: Deep inspection cards detailing special character entropy, keyword traps, ASN routing, and Let\'s Encrypt TLS freshness with one-click domain quarantine, STIX 2.1 IOC export, and raw HTTP stream packet dump.\n\n- **Threat Telemetry & Scan Audit Log**:\n  - **Multi-Status Filter Pills**: Instant filtering across *All Verdicts*, *Malicious*, *Suspicious*, and *Safe* records, complete with count badges.\n  - **Full-Text Omnibar Filter**: Fast filtering by domain, IP, hash, or trigger.\n  - **Forensic Modal Drawer**: Slide-up sheet providing deep registrar intel, fast-flux DNS TTLs, and DOM clone attack vectors.\n  - **Bulk Remediation Footer**: Multi-select actions to batch quarantine threats or export audit trails directly to CSV.\n\n- **Sentinel AI Advisor (Interactive Cyber Intelligence Assistant)**:\n  - **Dual Interaction Modes**: Switch between structured text diagnostics and active voice recognition modes.\n  - **Voice Orb Diagnostic Visualizer**: Kinetic radar orb with harmonic audio frequencies, pulsing waveforms, and simulated voice synthesis.\n  - **Analytical Timeline**: Conversational thread demonstrating automated classification rationale, homoglyph root cause analysis, DNS sinkhole injection, and SIEM ticket generation.\n  - **Tactical Prompt Chips**: One-click quick queries for Punycode analysis, OAuth verification, DKIM/DMARC headers, and YARA rule generation.\n\n- **SOC Engine & Radar Configuration**:\n  - Fine-grained controls to toggle heuristic detection sensitivity (*Aggressive*, *Balanced*, *Strict*), automated DNS sinkhole injection, external threat feeds (*AlienVault OTX*, *VirusTotal*, *PhishTank*, *CISA*), and SIEM dispatcher integrations."
