  user_input {
    user_response: "Redesign the existing PhishGuard AI dashboard UI without changing the existing functionality.\n\nCRITICAL FIX:\n\nRemove the entire bottom navigation bar completely.\n\nThe bottom navigation currently contains duplicate menu items such as:\n- SOC / Dashboard\n- Scan\n- Logs / Scan History\n- Sentinel / AI Assistant\n- Config / Settings\n\nDELETE this bottom navigation completely.\n\nNavigation must exist ONLY in the LEFT SIDEBAR.\n\nKeep a fixed professional vertical sidebar on the left side of the desktop layout.\n\nThe sidebar should contain:\n- Dashboard\n- URL Scanner\n- Scan History\n- AI Security Chatbot\n- Security Tips\n- Settings\n\nThe main dashboard content must occupy the entire area to the RIGHT of the sidebar.\n\nDo not place any duplicate navigation, tabs, or bottom menu on desktop.\n\nImprove the overall dashboard layout to look like a premium modern cybersecurity SaaS application.\n\nUse:\n- Dark charcoal background\n- Purple/Violet accents for AI\n- Teal/Cyan accents for technology\n- Green for safe websites\n- Orange for suspicious websites\n- Red for phishing threats\n\nAvoid making blue the dominant color.\n\nImprove spacing, alignment, card hierarchy, typography, and visual balance.\n\nCreate a clean dashboard with:\n- Top header\n- Scan URL button\n- Total Scans\n- Safe Websites\n- Suspicious Websites\n- Phishing Websites\n- Risk Analytics chart\n- Recent Scan Activity\n- AI-powered protection section\n- Security Tips section\n\nMake the desktop UI spacious and professional.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nThere must be NO bottom navigation bar.\nNavigation should appear ONLY in the left sidebar."
    items {
      text: "Redesign the existing PhishGuard AI dashboard UI without changing the existing functionality.\n\nCRITICAL FIX:\n\nRemove the entire bottom navigation bar completely.\n\nThe bottom navigation currently contains duplicate menu items such as:\n- SOC / Dashboard\n- Scan\n- Logs / Scan History\n- Sentinel / AI Assistant\n- Config / Settings\n\nDELETE this bottom navigation completely.\n\nNavigation must exist ONLY in the LEFT SIDEBAR.\n\nKeep a fixed professional vertical sidebar on the left side of the desktop layout.\n\nThe sidebar should contain:\n- Dashboard\n- URL Scanner\n- Scan History\n- AI Security Chatbot\n- Security Tips\n- Settings\n\nThe main dashboard content must occupy the entire area to the RIGHT of the sidebar.\n\nDo not place any duplicate navigation, tabs, or bottom menu on desktop.\n\nImprove the overall dashboard layout to look like a premium modern cybersecurity SaaS application.\n\nUse:\n- Dark charcoal background\n- Purple/Violet accents for AI\n- Teal/Cyan accents for technology\n- Green for safe websites\n- Orange for suspicious websites\n- Red for phishing threats\n\nAvoid making blue the dominant color.\n\nImprove spacing, alignment, card hierarchy, typography, and visual balance.\n\nCreate a clean dashboard with:\n- Top header\n- Scan URL button\n- Total Scans\n- Safe Websites\n- Suspicious Websites\n- Phishing Websites\n- Risk Analytics chart\n- Recent Scan Activity\n- AI-powered protection section\n- Security Tips section\n\nMake the desktop UI spacious and professional.\n\nIMPORTANT:\nThere must be NO bottom navigation bar.\nNavigation should appear ONLY in the left sidebar."
