  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Dashboard Structure**\n\nI\'m currently focused on structuring the dashboard view. I\'ve broken down the requirements: a top header, scan URL button, scan tallies, website categorization, a risk analytics chart, recent scan activity, an AI-powered section, and a security tips section. I\'m considering the best visual arrangement to optimize user experience.\n\n\n**Refining Style and Structure**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into the styling guidelines. I\'m focusing on the color palette, particularly the dark charcoal background and the use of purple/violet for the AI elements, and teal/cyan for technology. The intent is to align colors with specific threat levels, with green for safe, orange for suspicious, and red for phishing. I\'m actively reviewing `SocCommandCenter.tsx` to understand its current functionality and am deciding whether to enhance it or build a new high-fidelity dashboard to meet all specified requirements. I\'ve begun inspecting the props of `SocCommandCenter` and also began defining all the items in the dashboard.\n\n\n**Visualizing Scan Data**\n\nI\'m now detailing the visual presentation of scan results. Safe websites will be highlighted with a vibrant green, while suspicious sites use orange, and phishing sites use a bold red. The risk chart will be a 7-day trend chart with a donut gauge, showing the percentage breakdown. Recent scan activity will be displayed as a live feed. I\'ve also thought about color coding for attack vectors.\n\n\n**Detailing Feature Integration**\n\nI\'m now integrating detailed features into the layout. Specifically, I\'m adding an intercepted vector/payload detail with timestamp data and an \"Inspect\" button that directly opens the URL Scanner. The AI-Powered Protection section will showcase Sentinel AI capabilities, including a neural heuristic OCR, LLM classifier, and anti-evasion sandbox metrics, all accented in purple/violet. This includes interactive AI actions for testing phishing prompts or launching an AI assistant. Finally, the Security Tips section will provide interactive security awareness cards on various threats with \"Read Full Playbook\" buttons.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_91518"
      name: "create_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"Content\":\"import { useState } from \'react\';\\nimport { PlaybookModule } from \'../types\';\\nimport { PLAYBOOK_MODULES } from \'../data/mockData\';\\nimport {\\n  Shield,\\n  ShieldCheck,\\n  AlertTriangle,\\n  Flame,\\n  Search,\\n  Bot,\\n  Sparkles,\\n  ArrowRight,\\n  TrendingUp,\\n  Activity,\\n  CheckCircle2,\\n  ExternalLink,\\n  ChevronRight,\\n  Lightbulb,\\n  Radar,\\n  Lock,\\n  Layers,\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\n\\ninterface SocCommandCenterProps {\\n  onScanUrl: (url: string) => void;\\n  onOpenPlaybook: (playbook: PlaybookModule) => void;\\n  onNavigateToTips?: () => void;\\n  onNavigateToChatbot?: () => void;\\n}\\n\\nexport default function SocCommandCenter({\\n  onScanUrl,\\n  onOpenPlaybook,\\n  onNavigateToTips,\\n  onNavigateToChatbot,\\n}: SocCommandCenterProps) {\\n  const [quickScanOpen, setQuickScanOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [quickInputUrl, setQuickInputUrl] = useState(\'\');\\n  const [isScanning, setIsScanning] = useState(false);\\n  const [scanFeedback, setScanFeedback] = useState<string | null>(null);\\n\\n  const handleQuickScan = (targetUrl?: string) => {\\n    const val = (targetUrl || quickInputUrl).trim();\\n    if (!val) {\\n      setQuickScanOpen(true);\\n      return;\\n    }\\n    setIsScanning(true);\\n    setScanFeedback(null);\\n\\n    setTimeout(() => {\\n      setIsScanning(false);\\n      setScanFeedback(\'Analysis initialized. Transferring to Neural URL Scanner...\');\\n      setTimeout(() => {\\n        onScanUrl(val);\\n      }, 500);\\n    }, 800);\\n  };\\n\\n  // Recent scan activity records\\n  const recentScans = [\\n    {\\n      id: \'scan-1\',\\n      domain: \'paypal-security-update-login.top\',\\n      fullUrl: \'https://paypal-security-update-login.top/signin\',\\n      verdict: \'phishing\',\\n      verdictLabel: \'Phishing Threat\',\\n      score: 98,\\n      vector: \'Credential Harvester Clone\',\\n      time: \'1m ago\',\\n      ip: \'185.220.101.5\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'scan-2\',\\n      domain: \'auth-microsoft365-verify.cc\',\\n      fullUrl: \'https://auth-microsoft365-verify.cc/login\',\\n      verdict: \'phishing\',\\n      verdictLabel: \'Phishing Threat\',\\n      score: 94,\\n      vector: \'AiTM Reverse Proxy Token Hijack\',\\n      time: \'4m ago\',\\n      ip: \'194.38.20.14\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'scan-3\',\\n      domain: \'cryptowallet-ledger-airdrop.xyz\',\\n      fullUrl: \'https://cryptowallet-ledger-airdrop.xyz\',\\n      verdict: \'suspicious\',\\n      verdictLabel: \'Suspicious Website\',\\n      score: 74,\\n      vector: \'Drainer Contract Reference\',\\n      time: \'11m ago\',\\n      ip: \'104.21.32.7\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'scan-4\',\\n      domain: \'github-status.org\',\\n      fullUrl: \'https://github-status.org\',\\n      verdict: \'suspicious\',\\n      verdictLabel: \'Suspicious Website\',\\n      score: 68,\\n      vector: \'Typosquatting Homoglyph Divergence\',\\n      time: \'19m ago\',\\n      ip: \'172.67.140.2\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'scan-5\',\\n      domain: \'app.slack.com/client\',\\n      fullUrl: \'https://app.slack.com/client/T024/C081\',\\n      verdict: \'safe\',\\n      verdictLabel: \'Safe Website\',\\n      score: 2,\\n      vector: \'DigiCert EV Root \342\200\242 Legitimate Enterprise\',\\n      time: \'28m ago\',\\n      ip: \'34.225.109.88\',\\n    },\\n    {\\n      id: \'scan-6\',\\n      domain: \'stripe.com/billing\',\\n      fullUrl: \'https://stripe.com/billing\',\\n      verdict: \'safe\',\\n      verdictLabel: \'Safe Website\',\\n      score: 4,\\n      vector: \'Valid TLS 1.3 \342\200\242 Verified Organization\',\\n      time: \'45m ago\',\\n      ip: \'54.187.112.9\',\\n    },\\n  ];\\n\\n  // Timeline datapoints for the Risk Analytics Chart\\n  const trendDays = [\\n    { day: \'Mon\', safe: 1820, suspicious: 240, phishing: 94 },\\n    { day: \'Tue\', safe: 1940, suspicious: 290, phishing: 110 },\\n    { day: \'Wed\', safe: 2100, suspicious: 310, phishing: 105 },\\n    { day: \'Thu\', safe: 2050, suspicious: 280, phishing: 88 },\\n    { day: \'Fri\', safe: 2310, suspicious: 340, phishing: 125 },\\n    { day: \'Sat\', safe: 1780, suspicious: 190, phishing: 52 },\\n    { day: \'Sun\', safe: 2410, suspicious: 192, phishing: 66 },\\n  ];\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 space-y-6\\\">\\n      {/* Top Banner & Quick Action Header */}\\n      <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-[#141722] border border-[#242a38] p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"absolute right-0 top-0 w-96 h-96 bg-purple-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\\\" />\\n        <div className=\\\"absolute left-1/4 bottom-0 w-64 h-64 bg-teal-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\\\" />\\n\\n        <div className=\\\"relative z-10 flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-4\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"space-y-1.5\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"relative flex h-2.5 w-2.5\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-teal-400 opacity-75\\\" />\\n                <span className=\\\"relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-teal-500\\\" />\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-wider text-teal-400 uppercase\\\">\\n                PhishGuard SOC Command Center \342\200\242 Engine v4.8 Live\\n              </span>\\n            </div>\\n            <h1 className=\\\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\\\">\\n              Threat Intelligence & Phishing Defense\\n            </h1>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-zinc-400 max-w-2xl\\\">\\n              Autonomous multi-vector inspection engine monitoring global traffic, zero-day typosquatting, credential harvesting clones, and adversary-in-the-middle proxies.\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Prominent Scan URL Action Button */}\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3 shrink-0\\\">\\n            <button\\n              id=\\\"topScanUrlBtn\\\"\\n              onClick={() => setQuickScanOpen(!quickScanOpen)}\\n              className=\\\"px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-purple-500 hover:from-purple-500 hover:to-purple-400 text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-[0_0_24px_rgba(168,85,247,0.35)] flex items-center gap-2 active:scale-95 transition-all cursor-pointer\\\"\\n            >\\n              <Radar className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-purple-200\\\" />\\n              <span>Scan URL</span>\\n            </button>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Quick URL Ingestion Dropdown Bar */}\\n        {quickScanOpen && (\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-[#242a38] space-y-3 animate-fadeIn\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-purple-300\\\">\\n                Direct Neural Diagnostics Ingestion\\n              </span>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setQuickScanOpen(false)}\\n                className=\\\"text-zinc-500 hover:text-zinc-300 text-xs font-mono\\\"\\n              >\\n                Close\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"relative flex items-center\\\">\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"text\\\"\\n                value={quickInputUrl}\\n                onChange={(e) => setQuickInputUrl(e.target.value)}\\n                onKeyDown={(e) => e.key === \'Enter\' && handleQuickScan()}\\n                placeholder=\\\"Paste suspect domain or link (e.g. https://wellsfarg0-verify.com/auth)...\\\"\\n                className=\\\"w-full h-11 pl-4 pr-28 rounded-xl bg-[#0d0f15] border border-[#2a3142] text-sm text-white placeholder:text-zinc-500 focus:outline-none focus:border-purple-500 font-mono shadow-inner\\\"\\n              />\\n              <button\\n                disabled={isScanning}\\n                onClick={() => handleQuickScan()}\\n                className=\\\"absolute right-1.5 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-500 text-white font-bold text-xs shadow transition-all disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n              >\\n                {isScanning ? \'Inspecting...\' : \'Analyze\'}\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Quick presets */}\\n            <div className=\\\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-zinc-500 font-mono\\\">Test samples:</span>\\n              {[\\n                { label: \'Wells Fargo Clone\', url: \'https://wellsfarg0-verify.com/auth\' },\\n                { label: \'Apple ID Spoof\', url: \'https://login-apple-icloud-security.net\' },\\n                { label: \'Legitimate Slack\', url: \'https://app.slack.com/client/T024/C081\' },\\n              ].map((sample, idx) => (\\n                <button\\n                  key={idx}\\n                  onClick={() => {\\n                    setQuickInputUrl(sample.url);\\n                    handleQuickScan(sample.url);\\n                  }}\\n                  className=\\\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-[#181c28] hover:bg-[#202636] text-teal-400 border border-[#272f42] font-mono text-[11px] cursor-pointer\\\"\\n                >\\n                  {sample.label}\\n                </button>\\n              ))}\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {scanFeedback && (\\n              <div className=\\\"p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-teal-950/30 border border-teal-500/30 text-xs text-teal-300 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n                <CheckCircle2 className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-400\\\" />\\n                <span>{scanFeedback}</span>\\n              </div>\\n            )}\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* 4 Metric Cards (Requested: Total Scans, Safe Websites, Suspicious Websites, Phishing Websites) */}\\n      <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4\\\">\\n        {/* Metric 1: Total Scans */}\\n        <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-[#141722] border border-[#242a38] p-5 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-[#353d52] transition-colors\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400 font-mono\\\">\\n              Total Scans\\n            </span>\\n            <div className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-teal-500/10 border border-teal-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-teal-400\\\">\\n              <Activity className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-3\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\\\">14,892</div>\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-teal-400 font-medium\\\">\\n              <TrendingUp className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n              <span>+18.4% this week</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-teal-500 via-teal-400 to-transparent\\\" />\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Metric 2: Safe Websites (Green Accent) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-[#141722] border border-emerald-500/20 p-5 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-emerald-500/40 transition-colors\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 font-mono\\\">\\n              Safe Websites\\n            </span>\\n            <div className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-400\\\">\\n              <ShieldCheck className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-3\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\\\">12,410</div>\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-emerald-400 font-medium\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400\\\" />\\n              <span>83.3% verified clean</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-500 via-emerald-400 to-transparent\\\" />\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Metric 3: Suspicious Websites (Orange Accent) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-[#141722] border border-orange-500/20 p-5 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-orange-500/40 transition-colors\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-orange-400 font-mono\\\">\\n              Suspicious Websites\\n            </span>\\n            <div className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-orange-500/10 border border-orange-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-orange-400\\\">\\n              <AlertTriangle className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-3\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\\\">1,842</div>\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-orange-400 font-medium\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-orange-400\\\" />\\n              <span>12.4% under review</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 via-orange-400 to-transparent\\\" />\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Metric 4: Phishing Websites (Red Accent) */}\\n        <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-[#141722] border border-red-500/20 p-5 shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-red-500/40 transition-colors\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-red-400 font-mono\\\">\\n              Phishing Websites\\n            </span>\\n            <div className=\\\"w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-red-400\\\">\\n              <Flame className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-3\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight\\\">640</div>\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-1 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs text-red-400 font-medium\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-400 animate-pulse\\\" />\\n              <span>4.3% critical blocked</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"absolute bottom-0 inset-x-0 h-0.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-500 via-red-400 to-transparent\\\" />\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      {/* Risk Analytics Chart Section */}\\n      <div className=\\\"rounded-2xl bg-[#141722] border border-[#242a38] p-5 sm:p-6 shadow-sm space-y-6\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <h2 className=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white\\\">Risk Analytics & Threat Distribution</h2>\\n            <p className=\\\"text-xs text-zinc-400\\\">\\n              Automated classification telemetry across 14-day heuristic surveillance window\\n            </p>\\n          </div>\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#1c2130] text-zinc-300 text-xs font-mono border border-[#283042]\\\">\\n              7-DAY WINDOW\\n            </span>\\n            <span className=\\\"px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-teal-500/15 text-teal-400 text-xs font-mono font-bold border border-teal-500/30\\\">\\n              95.7% AUTO-FILTERED\\n            </span>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {/* Analytics Visual Grid: Donut + Bar Trend + Attack Vectors */}\\n        <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\\\">\\n          {/* Donut Radial Breakdown (Green, Orange, Red) */}\\n          <div className=\\\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0f1118] border border-[#222736] flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400 mb-3 block\\\">\\n              Classification Breakdown\\n            </span>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-center gap-4 py-2\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"relative w-32 h-32 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center\\\">\\n                <svg className=\\\"w-32 h-32 -rotate-90\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 100 100\\\">\\n                  <circle cx=\\\"50\\\" cy=\\\"50\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" r=\\\"38\\\" stroke=\\\"#1f2433\\\" strokeWidth=\\\"10\\\" />\\n                  {/* Safe (Green): 83.3% */}\\n                  <circle\\n                    cx=\\\"50\\\"\\n                    cy=\\\"50\\\"\\n                    fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n                    r=\\\"38\\\"\\n                    stroke=\\\"#22c55e\\\"\\n                    strokeDasharray=\\\"238.76\\\"\\n                    strokeDashoffset=\\\"40\\\"\\n                    strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n                    strokeWidth=\\\"10\\\"\\n                  />\\n                  {/* Suspicious (Orange): 12.4% */}\\n                  <circle\\n                    cx=\\\"50\\\"\\n                    cy=\\\"50\\\"\\n                    fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n                    r=\\\"38\\\"\\n                    stroke=\\\"#f97316\\\"\\n                    strokeDasharray=\\\"29.6 238.76\\\"\\n                    strokeDashoffset=\\\"-168\\\"\\n                    strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n                    strokeWidth=\\\"10\\\"\\n                  />\\n                  {/* Phishing (Red): 4.3% */}\\n                  <circle\\n                    cx=\\\"50\\\"\\n                    cy=\\\"50\\\"\\n                    fill=\\\"none\\\"\\n                    r=\\\"38\\\"\\n                    stroke=\\\"#ef4444\\\"\\n                    strokeDasharray=\\\"10.2 238.76\\\"\\n                    strokeDashoffset=\\\"-200\\\"\\n                    strokeLinecap=\\\"round\\\"\\n                    strokeWidth=\\\"10\\\"\\n                  />\\n                </svg>\\n                <div className=\\\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center pointer-events-none\\\">\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-xl font-bold text-white\\\">99.8%</span>\\n                  <span className=\\\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-teal-400 uppercase\\\">PRECISION</span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              {/* Legend */}\\n              <div className=\\\"space-y-2 flex-1\\\">\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-zinc-200\\\">Safe</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-mono font-bold text-emerald-400\\\">83.3%</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-orange-500 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-zinc-200\\\">Suspicious</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-mono font-bold text-orange-400\\\">12.4%</span>\\n                </div>\\n                <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs\\\">\\n                  <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                    <span className=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-zinc-200\\\">Phishing</span>\\n                  </div>\\n                  <span className=\\\"font-mono font-bold text-red-400\\\">4.3%</span>\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"pt-3 border-t border-[#1f2433] text-[11px] text-zinc-500 font-mono text-center\\\">\\n              Autonomous False-Positive Rate: &lt; 0.02%\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* 7-Day Activity Trend (Bar / Volume visual) */}\\n          <div className=\\\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#0f1118] border border-[#222736] flex flex-col justify-between\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400\\\">\\n                Daily Intercept Trend\\n              </span>\\n              <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-zinc-500 font-mono\\\">Volume / 24h</span>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"h-40 flex items-end gap-2 pt-4 px-2\\\">\\n              {trendDays.map((item, idx) => {\\n                const total = item.safe + item.suspicious + item.phishing;\\n                const heightPct = Math.min(100, Math.round((total / 2800) * 100));\\n                return (\\n                  <div key={idx} className=\\\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5 h-full justify-end\\\">\\n                    <div className=\\\"w-full flex flex-col-reverse rou