  planner_response {
    response: "I have completely redesigned the **PhishGuard AI** cybersecurity dashboard to match a premium modern cybersecurity SaaS application.\n\n### Architectural & Functional Implementation\n\n- **Complete Removal of Bottom Navigation**: Completely removed the bottom navigation bar and any duplicate bottom menus. All application routing and navigation now exist exclusively within the dedicated vertical left sidebar.\n- **Fixed Left Sidebar Navigation**: Implemented a fixed professional vertical sidebar (`w-64` / `w-72`) containing the exact required navigation structure:\n  1. **Dashboard**: Central SOC threat telemetry, risk analytics, and real-time feed.\n  2. **URL Scanner**: Deep neural heuristic analysis, OCR clone comparison, and DOM reverse-proxy detection.\n  3. **Scan History**: Full audit logs, forensics inspection modal, and CSV export.\n  4. **AI Security Chatbot**: Sentinel conversational threat intelligence advisor.\n  5. **Security Tips**: Interactive tactical defense guides, MITRE ATT&CK T1566 phishing breakdown, and live incident playbooks.\n  6. **Settings**: Autonomous engine sensitivity, threat intelligence feeds, and SIEM webhooks.\n- **Dedicated Layout to the Right of the Sidebar**: The main dashboard area now spans the entire space to the right of the sidebar with responsive desktop padding (`lg:pl-64 xl:pl-72`).\n- **Modern Cybersecurity SaaS Theme**:\n  - **Dark Charcoal Background**: Deep dark charcoal surfaces (`#0e1117`, `#111319`, `#141722`) with high-contrast borders (`#222733`, `#262c3b`).\n  - **Purple/Violet Accents**: Applied to Sentinel AI features, neural analysis, and threat advisor components.\n  - **Teal/Cyan Accents**: Applied to technology indicators, autonomous radar cluster badges, and system latency telemetry.\n  - **Vibrant Semantic Status Tones**:\n    - **Green** for Safe Websites (12,410 verified clean).\n    - **Orange** for Suspicious Websites (1,842 under review).\n    - **Red** for Phishing Threats (640 blocked).\n- **Core Dashboard Modules**:\n  - **Top Header**: Global threat search bar, autonomous radar toggle, threat notification indicators, and analyst profile.\n  - **Scan URL Button**: Prominent trigger in the header and dashboard opening immediate URL ingestion with sample targets.\n  - **4 Metric Cards**: Total Scans, Safe Websites, Suspicious Websites, and Phishing Websites.\n  - **Risk Analytics Chart**: Multi-layer risk telemetry featuring a classification donut breakdown (83.3% safe, 12.4% suspicious, 4.3% phishing), a 7-day daily intercept volume chart, and top intercepted attack vectors.\n  - **Recent Scan Activity**: Live intercept table displaying analyzed domains, IP addresses, verdict badges, threat scores, and instant inspection triggers.\n  - **AI-Powered Protection Section**: Violet-accented Sentinel AI module showcasing visual logo spoof detection, anti-AiTM proxy interception, and conversational forensics.\n  - **Security Tips Section**: Actionable threat prevention playbooks (Punycode inspection, Spoofed landing page heuristics, Credential isolation) with direct modal readers."
    thinking: "**Verifying Requirements Thoroughly**\n\nOkay, I\'ve just meticulously cross-referenced the initial project brief with the implementation progress. I\'ve now confirmed the complete removal of the bottom navigation bar and updated all associated imports as indicated.\n\n\n"
